+# Share a claim with another person on the sheet (the body's personId) at a percent of its due (the body's share: two
+# decimals, more than 0.00): CLAIM_SHARED is written. The holder's due-total counts their part of the claim's due, and
+# the claim's own person's the rest. The claim's own person, a person already holding a share, shares adding up to
+# more than 100.00, or a SETTLED, VOID or DELETED claim is refused (400) and writes nothing.
